    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、【2024 上海海事大学 2】已知连续时间信号 $x_{1}(t) = e^{-2t} u(t)$ , $x_{2}(t) = u(t) -$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            137,
            811,
            156
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$u(t - 2)$ , 求 $x_{1}(t)$ 和 $x_{2}(\\frac{t}{2})$ 的卷积 $y(t)$ , $y(t) = x_{1}(t) * x_{2}(\\frac{t}{2})$ , 并画出 $y(t)$ 示意图;",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            163,
            811,
            184
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "312- 解：",
        "bbox": [
            137,
            187,
            236,
            256
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nx _ {2} | t | = u (t) - u (t - 2)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            262,
            191,
            438,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{则} x _ {2} (\\frac {t}{2}) = u (t) - u (t - 4)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            233,
            239,
