    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime} (t) + 5 y (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f (\\tau) x (t - \\tau) d \\tau - f (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            135,
            663,
            159
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "其中 $x(t) = e^{-t}u(t) + 3\\delta (t)$ ，求单位冲激 $h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            167,
            549,
            185
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $y(t) + 5y(t) = f(t) * x(t) - f(t)$ $\\Rightarrow h(t) + 5h(t) = \\delta(t) * x(t) - \\delta(t) = x(t) - \\delta(t) = e^{-t}u(t) + 2\\sqrt{t}$ $\\Rightarrow h(t) = A e^{-5t}$ (齐次部分) $t > 0$ 时，方切项 $= e^{-t} \\Rightarrow hp(t) = Be^{-t}$ $-Be^{-t} + 5Be^{-t} = e^{-t} \\Rightarrow B = \\frac{1}{4}$ $\\Rightarrow h(t) = A e^{-5t} + \\frac{1}{4}e^{-t}$ $\\begin{cases} h(t) = a\\sqrt{t} + b\\Delta(u(t)) \\Rightarrow a = 2 \\\\ h(t) = a\\Delta(u(t)) \\Rightarrow h(0+) = h(0-1) + 2 = 2 \\\\ h(0+) = A + \\frac{1}{4} = 2 \\Rightarrow A = \\frac{7}{4} \\\\ \\therefore h(t) = (\\frac{7}{4}e^{-5t} + \\frac{1}{4}e^{-t})u(t) \\end{cases}$",
        "bbox": [
            164,
            188,
            892,
            568
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
