    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、【2024西安理工大学3.1】当 $f(t)=\\delta(t)$ 时， $y_{zs1}(t)=\\delta(t)-\\delta(t-1)$ ， $y_{zs2}(t)=\\delta(t-2)-\\delta(t-3)$ ，求当 $f(t)=u(t)$ 时的 $y_{zs}(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            110,
            761,
            153
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/821f87f51cfd1306aab03aa93bf17ef96fe8902f74f3e8844b1dbcb378cfc937.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            275,
