            675,
            311
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：由题意可知： $y_{x_1}|t| = h_1(t)$ $y_{x_2}|t| = h_2(t)$ $\\Rightarrow h_{1}|t| = h_1(t) - h_2|t| = \\delta_{1+1} - \\delta(t-1) - \\delta(t-2) + \\delta(t-3)$ $\\Rightarrow y_{x_1}|t| = h_{1}|t + u(t)| = u(t) - u(t-1) - u(t-2) + u(t-3)$",
