    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、【2024 合肥工业大学 2】一个LTI连续时间系统的输出与输入关系关系为：",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            781,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (t) = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} e ^ {\\tau - t} x (\\tau - 2) d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            389,
            131,
            603,
            167
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) 求该系统的单位冲激响应 $h(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            175,
            473,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) 当输入信号为 $x(t) = e^{-2t} u(t)$ 时, 求输出信号。",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            198,
            596,
            216
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y (t)} & {= \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} e ^ {t - t} x (\\tau - 2) u (t - \\tau) d \\tau} \\\\ & {= x (t - 2) * e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= x (t) * \\sqrt {(t - 2) * e ^ {- t} u (t)}} \\\\ & {= x (t) * e ^ {- (t - 2)} u (t - 2)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            233,
            235,
            600,
            391
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore h (- t) = e ^ {- (t - 2)} u (t - 2)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            218,
            397,
            457,
            429
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $y_{t1} = x_{1} t_{1} + h_{1}(t)$ $= e^{-x_{1}} u_{t1} + e^{-t_{1}} u_{t1} + d_{t-2}$",
        "bbox": [
            631,
            226,
            932,
            309
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{其中}} & {e ^ {- 2 t} u \\mathrm{tr} t * e ^ {- t} u \\mathrm{tr},} \\\\ & {= \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- 2 t} \\cdot e ^ {- (t - \\tau)} d \\tau \\cdot u (\\tau)} \\\\ & {= e ^ {- t} \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- \\tau} d \\tau \\cdot u (\\tau)} \\\\ & {= e ^ {- t} [ - e ^ {- \\tau} ] _ {0} ^ {t} u (\\tau)} \\\\ & {= e ^ {- t} [ - e ^ {- t} + 1 ] u (\\tau)} \\\\ & {= (- e ^ {- 2 t} + e ^ {- t}) u (\\tau)} \\\\ & {= [ - e ^ {- 2 (t - 2)} + e ^ {- (t - 2)} ] u (\\tau - 2),} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            621,
