    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故 $y(t) = y_{1}(t) - y_{2}(t) = x(t) \\times h_{1}(t) - x(t) \\times h_{2}(t)$ $= x(t) \\times [h_{1}(t) - h_{2}(t)]$ $= > h(t) = h_{1}(t) - h_{2}(t)$ $= u(t-1) - u(t-5) - 2(t-3)$",
