    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "5、【2024 浙江大学 1.2】某连续线性时不变系统, 在 3 种激励下的初始状态相同:",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            112,
            811,
            129
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "当 $x_{1}(t) = \\delta (t)$ 时，全响应 $y_{1}(t) = \\delta (t) + e^{-t}u(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            136,
            574,
            155
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "当 $x_{2}(t)=u(t)$ 时，全响应 $y_{2}(t)=3e^{-t}u(t)$ ;",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            161,
            529,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "求当 $x_{3}(t) = e^{-2t}u(t)$ 时，全响应 $y_{3}(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            185,
            484,
            204
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "令积分输入响应为 $y_{2}(t)$ . 则",
        "bbox": [
            171,
            203,
            549,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y _ {1} (t)} & {= y _ {2 i} (t) + h (t) = \\delta (t) + e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ {y _ {2} (t)} & {= y _ {2 i} (t) + g (t) = 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ {\\frac {g (t) - g (t)}{}} & {= \\delta (t) - 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ {\\Rightarrow g (t)} & {[ \\delta^ {i} (t) - \\delta^ {i} (t) ] = \\delta (t) - 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow g (t) = e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {\\Rightarrow \\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {h (t)} & {= - e ^ {- t} u (t) + \\delta (t)} \\\\ {y _ {2 i} (t)} & {= 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\end{array} \\right.} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            236,
            635,
            561
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这样写源于",
        "bbox": [
            685,
            340,
            826,
            380
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{对}} & {[ e ^ {- \\alpha^ {+} u (e)}} ] \\\\ & {= - \\alpha e ^ {- \\alpha^ {+} u (e)} + \\delta (e)} \\\\ & {\\mathrm{的充分学拓展}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            660,
            378,
            902,
            478
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若无记学堆可用记",
        "bbox": [
            673,
            471,
            924,
            522
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\therefore f\\left( t\\right)$ 求导一原型 $= {0.5}{\\left( t - 1\\right) }^{ - } - 2{p}^{-t}{a}_{1}{b}_{1}$",
        "bbox": [
            677,
            530,
            939,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {y _ {3 | t |}} & {= h (t) * x _ {3 | t |} + y _ {2 | t |}} \\\\ & {= [ - e ^ {- t} u (t) + \\sqrt {t}) ] * e ^ {- x _ {1}} u (t) + 2 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\end{array} \\Rightarrow q _ {1 e _ {1}} \\text {   中   } [ e ^ {- t} u (t) ] ^ {\\prime} = - e ^ {- t} u (t) + o (t) \\text {   涡示权   }\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            164,
            572,
            779,
            662
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow  {910}$ 中奇定有 ${e}^{- + }{u}_{0}{e}_{1}$",
        "bbox": [
            677,
            574,
            902,
            610
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{其中} e ^ {- t} u _ {1 t 1} * e ^ {- 2 t} u _ {1 t 1}} & {= \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {- t} e ^ {- 2 (t - t)} d t \\cdot u _ {1 t 1} = e ^ {- 2 t} \\int_ {0} ^ {t} e ^ {t} d t \\cdot u _ {1 t 1}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\mathrm{for} y _ {3 | t 1} = (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- t}) u _ {1 t 1} + e ^ {- 2 t} u _ {1 t 1} + 2 e ^ {- t} u _ {1 t 1}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\mathrm{for} y _ {3 | t 1}} \\\\ & {\\qquad = (2 e ^ {- 2 t} + e ^ {- t}) u _ {1 t 1}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
